OL,3,AEuropean diplomats attacked by Israeli
OL,4,Asettlers in West Bank
OL,5,
OL,6,FA delegation of European diplomats has
OL,7,Fbeen attacked by masked Israeli
OL,8,Fsettlers in the occupied West Bank.
OL,10,FBelgium condemned the assault on its
OL,11,Fconsul general and the other envoys and
OL,12,Fcalled for Israel to bring those
OL,13,Fresponsible to justice.
OL,15,FThe Israel Defense Forces (IDF) also
OL,16,Fcondemned what they called "the severe
OL,17,Fact of violence" and said they were
OL,18,Finvestigating.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
