OL,3,ADeadly fire breaks out at Canada
OL,4,Amilitary base
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada's Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,7,Fsaid on X that a "serious incident
OL,8,Fcreating a major fire" had occurred,
OL,9,Fadding his "thoughts are with all the
OL,10,Fbrave women and men affected".
OL,12,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,13,Fthe fire broke out, is one of the
OL,14,Fcountry's busiest military training
OL,15,Fbases.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
