OL,3,ATrump waives several Russia sanctions
OL,4,Aas row with Zelensky intensifies
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump blocked
OL,7,Fnumerous sanctions on Russia two days
OL,8,Fbefore they were due to take effect, as
OL,9,Fa row with his Ukrainian counterpart
OL,10,FVolodymyr Zelensky deepens.
OL,12,FThe sanctions were passed by the US
OL,13,FCongress and signed into law by the
OL,14,Fpresident in September.
OL,16,FBut Trump issued an executive order
OL,17,FFriday night saying that suspending
OL,18,Fsome was in the US national interest,
OL,19,Fprompting a backlash from US lawmakers.
OL,20,FZelensky said it was unfortunate the US
OL,21,Fhas decided to "completely disregard"
OL,22,Fthe sanctions.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
